    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Inspecting Web Pages\r\n\r\nIn this level, your goal is to use the **Tag Inspector** to explore the \"hidden code\" that determine how webpages look and feel. In the next few levels, you'll be able to explore these more deeply\r\n\r\nThe **HTML Element** describes the _structure_ of your webpage. The **CSS Rules** describe the _style_ of your webpage. AI Tutor can help you understand how these new tags and rules work.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n- Move your mouse around the webpage and notice how the Tag Inspector on the right-side updates. Identify at least 2 different HTML tags and at least 2 CSS rules.\r\n- Pick one of the HTML or CSS you already identified to share with AI tutor: either ask AI Tutor to explain what it does, or take a guess on what it does and AI Tutor will tell you if you're right or wrong.\r\n\r\nOnce you've learned what at least 1 element does with AI tutor, Continue to the next page.",
